4. **ForwardingNode**
在扩容时才会出现的特殊节点，其key,value,hash全部为null。并拥有nextTable指针引用新的table数组。

		static final class ForwardingNode<K,V> extends Node<K,V> {
		    final Node<K,V>[] nextTable;
		    ForwardingNode(Node<K,V>[] tab) {
		        super(MOVED, null, null, null);
		        this.nextTable = tab;
		    }
		   .....
